{"at": "2026-11-12T02:26:16Z", "class": ["fact"], "evidence": ["run:20261112-022525-935a429e.log"], "id": "01425109a72586cb", "kind": "note", "scope": "global", "session": "c6b10d21-d185-5baa-af79-2ea3c6c03339", "source": "GitHub API 403 on POST /actions/workflows/sweep.yml/dispatches from the session's GitHub app, 2026-11-12", "text": "The Claude GitHub app in cloud sessions may be refused workflow_dispatch (403 Resource not accessible by integration); plan a first Action run on its schedule, or a one-tap 'Run workflow' step for the owner.", "trust": "external"}
{"at": "2026-11-12T02:26:23Z", "class": ["process"], "evidence": ["run:20261112-022525-935a429e.log"], "id": "b187d8fffa9a7823", "kind": "note", "scope": "global", "session": "c6b10d21-d185-5baa-af79-2ea3c6c03339", "text": "Parallel helpers that write documents must never run the build gate: LibreOffice (soffice) cannot run twice at once, so only the lead builds and checks page counts; brief helpers with a word-count proxy instead.", "trust": "observed"}
{"at": "2026-11-12T02:26:23Z", "class": ["practice"], "evidence": ["review:sha256-8e2705d737a4"], "id": "96a4089a2358416f", "kind": "note", "scope": "family:career", "session": "c6b10d21-d185-5baa-af79-2ea3c6c03339", "text": "Resume variants: put target job titles on their own 'Target roles:' line under the name, not as 'X or Y candidate' at the start of the summary. Recruiter title search is literal, so the exact posting title must appear, but a summary that opens with two titles reads as keyword-stuffing to a person.", "trust": "observed"}
{"at": "2026-11-12T02:26:24Z", "class": ["practice"], "evidence": ["review:sha256-271f249ffbc0"], "id": "cabd4b28e0409e4b", "kind": "note", "scope": "global", "session": "c6b10d21-d185-5baa-af79-2ea3c6c03339", "text": "A whole-system audit by a fresh reviewer after a big build found 35 issues, 6 must-fix (a 7-years role planned as apply-now, invented language, PII headed for git, contradictory pages). Run one before releasing a multi-page system.", "trust": "observed"}
{"at": "2026-11-12T02:26:29Z", "class": ["practice"], "evidence": ["review:sha256-0d3e2fb90382"], "id": "47b45c356852d1a0", "kind": "note", "scope": "family:career", "session": "c6b10d21-d185-5baa-af79-2ea3c6c03339", "text": "Simulated recruiter/hiring-manager fixes can contradict the owner's hard rules (e.g. 'add relocation willingness' when he will not relocate). Filter every simulated fix against the owner's rules before showing it.", "trust": "observed"}
